msgid "Region"
msgstr "区域"

msgid ""
"The ``REGION`` program allows a correlated method to be applied to a target "
"region within a molecule, where it is restricted to a subset of spatially "
"localised orbitals, and the rest of the valence electrons left uncorrelated "
"and only treated at the mean-field level."
msgstr ""
"``REGION`` "
"程序允许将相关方法应用于分子内的目标区域，该方法被限制在一组空间局域化的轨道子集内，而其余的价电子则保持非相关状态，仅在平均场水平进行处理。"

msgid ""
"The correlated region can be embedded within an SCF environment (that of the"
" reference wave function), or within a lower level correlated method using a"
" simple subtractive approach (see section `Multi-layer embedding "
"<region.html#multi-layer-embedding>`__). Multi-layer embedding can also be "
"achieved using the same subtractive approach."
msgstr ""
"相关区域可以嵌入到 SCF 环境（参考波函数的环境）中，或者使用简单的减法方法嵌入到较低级别的相关方法中（参见 `Multi-layer "
"embedding <region.html#multi-layer-embedding>`__ 节）。多层嵌入也可以通过相同的减法方法实现。"

msgid "Defining the Orbital Spaces"
msgstr "定义轨道空间"

msgid "The molecular orbitals are controlled using the directives:"
msgstr "分子轨道通过以下指令控制："

msgid ""
"Molecular orbitals are read from the dump record given after ``START``, and "
"saved to the dump record given after ``SAVE``"
msgstr "分子轨道从 ``START`` 后指定的转储记录中读取，并保存到 ``SAVE`` 后指定的转储记录中。"

msgid ""
"The initial occupancies of each orbital space are controlled using the usual"
" directives:"
msgstr "每个轨道空间的初始占据数使用常规指令控制："

msgid ""
"The correct number of core orbitals must be known to the ``REGION`` program "
"(either through inheriting it from the previous calculation, or through "
"explicit declaration by the user). The core orbitals are kept separate from "
"the inactive orbital space when performing the IBO localisation. If the "
"definition of the core is changed, these two spaces will mix, leading to a "
"slightly different set of embedded IBOs."
msgstr ""
"``REGION`` 程序必须知道正确的芯轨道数量（无论是从前一次计算继承而来，还是由用户明确定义）。在执行 IBO "
"局域化时，芯轨道与非活性轨道空间保持分离。如果芯的定义发生改变，这两个空间将会混合，导致产生一组略有不同的嵌入 IBO。"

msgid "Selecting the Embedded Orbitals"
msgstr "选择嵌入轨道"

msgid ""
"The IBOs to be embedded can be specified directly with the ``ORBITALS`` "
"option, either using their index, or as a range of indices e.g.,"
msgstr "要嵌入的IBO轨道可以直接通过\\ ``ORBITALS``\\ 选项指定，可以使用其索引，或使用索引范围，例如："

msgid ""
"Alternatively, the orbitals can be found automatically by choosing a set of "
"target atoms with the ``ATOMS`` option. Orbitals exerting an IBO partial "
"charge of at least ``THRESH_REGION`` (default=0.2 a.u.) on *any* of the "
"target atoms, are included in the embedding region. Atoms may be specified "
"using their names in the geometry specification, index, or using ranges of "
"indices e.g."
msgstr ""
"或者，可以通过使用\\ ``ATOMS``\\ 选项选择一组目标原子来自动找到轨道。对\\ *任何*\\ 目标原子施加至少\\ "
"``THRESH_REGION``\\ （默认=0.2 "
"a.u.）IBO部分电荷的轨道，将被包含在嵌入区域中。原子可以使用其在几何结构规范中的名称、索引或索引范围来指定，例如："

msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

msgid ""
"Further control of the ``ATOMS`` option is achieved using the ``ORB_SELECT``"
" option, which controls how strictly the target atoms inherit their "
"orbitals. When ``ORB_SELECT=INCLUSIVE`` (the default), an orbital is "
"embedded if *any* of the atoms it sits on are included in the target atoms. "
"When ``ORB_SELECT=EXCLUSIVE``, an orbital is only embedded if *all* the "
"atoms it sits on are included in the target atoms. For example, in the "
"following molecule:"
msgstr ""
"通过\\ ``ORB_SELECT``\\ 选项可以进一步控制\\ ``ATOMS``\\ 选项，该选项控制目标原子继承其轨道的严格程度。当\\ "
"``ORB_SELECT=INCLUSIVE``\\ （默认）时，如果轨道所在的\\ *任何*\\ 原子包含在目标原子中，则该轨道被嵌入。当\\ "
"``ORB_SELECT=EXCLUSIVE``\\ 时，仅当轨道所在的\\ *所有*\\ "
"原子都包含在目标原子中时，该轨道才被嵌入。例如，在以下分子中："

msgid "The command"
msgstr "命令"

msgid "selects only the carbon-carbon sigma and pi bonds, whereas the command"
msgstr "仅选择碳-碳σ键和π键，而命令"

msgid "selects all the bonds."
msgstr "选择所有键。"

msgid ""
"Core orbitals (as defined by the ``CORE`` variable) are exuded from the "
"embedding region."
msgstr "芯轨道（由\\ ``CORE``\\ 变量定义）被排除在嵌入区域之外。"

msgid ""
"Finally the embedded orbital space is made pseudo-canonical by diagonalising"
" the embedded-embedded block of the Fock matrix, and similarly the "
"active/open orbitals. This can be disabled by setting the "
"``SEMI_CAN=false``."
msgstr ""
"最后，通过对角化 Fock 矩阵的嵌入-嵌入块，使嵌入轨道空间成为伪正则的，对活性/开轨道也进行类似处理。这可以通过设置 "
"``SEMI_CAN=false`` 来禁用。"

msgid "Truncating the virtual space"
msgstr "截断虚空间"

msgid ""
"The ``FCI`` program, and some third-party programs interfaced to Molpro, can"
" handle a reduction in the number of virtual orbitals. This procedure is "
"called the *deleted virtual approximation*, and can significantly reduce the"
" cost of correlated calculations. When the option ``FULL_VIRT=false``, a "
"truncated virtual space localized to the embedding region is constructed "
"from projected atomic orbitals (PAOs). By default ``FULL_VIRT=true`` and the"
" full canonical virtual space from the previous SCF calculation is retained."
msgstr ""
"``FCI`` 程序以及一些与 Molpro 接口的第三方程序可以处理虚轨道数量的减少。此过程称为\\ *删除虚轨道近似*\\ "
"，可以显著降低关联计算的成本。当选项 ``FULL_VIRT=false`` "
"时，会从投影原子轨道（PAOs）构建一个定位于嵌入区域的截断虚空间。默认情况下 ``FULL_VIRT=true``\\ ，保留先前 SCF "
"计算得到的完整正则虚空间。"

msgid ""
"PAOs located on a set of ‘host atoms’ are transformed by means of a singular"
" value decomposition of their overlap matrix. Virtual functions with an "
"eigenvalue below ``THRESH_REDUN`` (default=\\ :math:`1.0\\times10^{-8}`) are"
" considered redundant and deleted. PAOs on the other, environment, atoms are"
" also discarded."
msgstr ""
"位于一组‘宿主原子’上的 PAOs 通过对其重叠矩阵进行奇异值分解来变换。特征值低于 ``THRESH_REDUN``\\ （默认=\\ "
":math:`1.0\\times10^{-8}`\\ ）的虚函数被视为冗余并被删除。位于其他环境原子上的 PAOs 也会被丢弃。"

msgid ""
"Host atoms are those sat ‘underneath’ the embedded occupied orbitals. When "
"the embedded orbitals exert an IBO partial charge of at least "
"``THRESH_REGION`` (default 0.2 a.u.) on an atom, then it is classified as a "
"host atom. Further host atoms may be manually included by using the "
"``HOST_ATOMS`` option. This allows the virtual domain to be extended."
msgstr ""
"宿主原子是那些位于嵌入占据轨道‘下方’的原子。当嵌入轨道对某个原子施加的 IBO 部分电荷至少为 ``THRESH_REGION``\\ （默认 0.2"
" a.u.）时，该原子即被归类为宿主原子。可以通过使用 ``HOST_ATOMS`` 选项手动包含更多的宿主原子。这允许扩展虚域。"

msgid ""
"The truncated virtual space is made pseudo-canonical by diagonalising the "
"virtual-virtual block of the Fock matrix. This can be disabled by setting "
"the ``SEMI_CAN=false``."
msgstr "通过对角化 Fock 矩阵的虚-虚块，使截断虚空间成为伪正则的。这可以通过设置 ``SEMI_CAN=false`` 来禁用。"

msgid "Multi-layer embedding"
msgstr "多层嵌入"

msgid ""
"Treating the environment with a second correlated method (that is usually "
"less expensive) is done with a simple subtractive embedding procedure, "
"defined as"
msgstr "使用第二种相关方法（通常成本较低）处理环境，是通过一个简单的减法嵌入过程完成的，定义为"

msgid "E = E_{low}(A+B) - E^{reg}_{low}(A) + E^{reg}_{high}(A)."
msgstr ""
"E = E_{low}(A+B) - E^{reg}_{low}(A) + E^{reg}_{high}(A).\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"The argument :math:`A` denotes the central target region, and :math:`B` the "
"environment, and the subscripts denote the accuracy (and cost) of the "
"correlated methods. :math:`E^{reg}_{low}(A)` is an energy calculation "
"performed using the ``REGION`` program, with a lower level correlated method"
" on the target region, for example MP2. Similarly :math:`E^{reg}_{high}(A)` "
"is performed with a higher level correlated method on the *same* target "
"region, for example CISD."
msgstr ""
"参数 :math:`A` 表示中心目标区域，\\ :math:`B` 表示环境，下标表示相关方法的精度（和成本）。\\ "
":math:`E^{reg}_{low}(A)` 是使用 ``REGION`` 程序在目标区域上使用较低级别相关方法（例如 "
"MP2）进行的能量计算。类似地，\\ :math:`E^{reg}_{high}(A)` 是在\\ *同一个*\\ 目标区域上使用更高级别相关方法（例如"
" CISD）进行的计算。"

msgid ""
"Multiple embedding layers can be achieved through repeatedly applying the "
"above equation."
msgstr "通过重复应用上述方程可以实现多层嵌入。"

msgid "Summary of all options"
msgstr "所有选项摘要"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "This is an example of embedding MRCI inside CASPT2 for Butane."
msgstr "这是一个在丁烷中将MRCI嵌入到CASPT2中的示例。"

msgid "References"
msgstr "参考文献"

msgid ""
"Hans-Joachim Werner and Andreas Hansen, Local Wave Function Embedding: "
"Correlation Regions in PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 Calculations `J. Phys. Chem. A "
"<https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/acs.jpca.4c06852>`__ **128**, 10936–10947 "
"(2024)."
msgstr ""
"Hans-Joachim Werner and Andreas Hansen, Local Wave Function Embedding: "
"Correlation Regions in PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 Calculations `J. Phys. Chem. A "
"<https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/acs.jpca.4c06852>`__ **128**, 10936–10947 "
"(2024)."

msgid ""
"Firstly, molecular orbitals are localised using the intrinsic bonding "
"orbital (IBO) method, described in chapter :doc:`intrinsic basis bonding "
"analysis (IAO/IBO) <intrinsic_basis_bonding_analysis_iao_ibo>`. Occupied "
"orbitals to be embedded are either chosen directly by the user, or the user "
"chooses a set of atoms, and the orbitals sat on these atoms are embedded "
"(see section `selecting the Embedded Orbitals <region.html#selecting-the-"
"embedded-orbitals>`__). The occupied orbitals are reordered putting the "
"embedded orbitals at the top, followed by the other valence orbitals which "
"are placed into the core. The embedded and active/open orbital spaces are "
"then made pseudo-canonical."
msgstr ""
"首先，使用内禀成键轨道（IBO）方法对分子轨道进行局域化，该方法在 :doc:`内禀基组成键分析 (IAO/IBO) "
"<intrinsic_basis_bonding_analysis_iao_ibo>` "
"一章中描述。待嵌入的占据轨道可由用户直接选择，或由用户选择一组原子，并将位于这些原子上的轨道嵌入（参见 `选择嵌入轨道 "
"<region.html#selecting-the-embedded-orbitals>`__ "
"一节）。占据轨道被重新排序，将嵌入轨道置于顶部，随后是放入核心的其他价层轨道。然后使嵌入轨道空间和活性/开放轨道空间成为赝正则轨道。"

msgid ""
"The virtual orbital space can also be reduced and localised to the embedding"
" region (see section `truncating the virtual space <region.html#truncating-"
"the-virtual-space>`__). This can only be utilised by the ``FCI`` program "
"within Molpro (and some third-party programs interfaced to Molpro), because "
"the number of molecular orbitals no longer equals the number of basis "
"functions. However, regional local coupled cluster can be performed "
":doc:`PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 program "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos>` (recommended, "
"see section `Correlation regions in the PNO program "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#correlation-"
"regions-in-the-pno-program>`__) or by the old (obsolete) :doc:`DF-LCCSD "
"program <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments>` (see section `correlating "
"subsets of electrons (REGION) <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#correlating-subsets-of-electrons-"
"region>`__ for details)."
msgstr ""
"虚轨道空间也可以被缩减并局域化到嵌入区域（参见 `截断虚空间 <region.html#truncating-the-virtual-space>`__"
" 一节）。这只能由 Molpro 内的 ``FCI`` 程序（以及一些与 Molpro "
"接口的第三方程序）使用，因为分子轨道数不再等于基函数数。然而，区域局域耦合簇可以通过 :doc:`PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 程序 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos>`\\ （推荐，参见 `PNO "
"程序中的相关区域 "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos.html#correlation-"
"regions-in-the-pno-program>`__ 一节）或旧的（已过时的）\\ :doc:`DF-LCCSD 程序 <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments>`\\ （详情参见 `关联电子子集 (REGION) <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#correlating-subsets-of-electrons-"
"region>`__ 一节）来执行。"

msgid "``START,$<$record.file$>$``"
msgstr "``START,$<$record.file$>$``"

msgid "``SAVE,$<$record.file$>$``"
msgstr "``SAVE,$<$record.file$>$``"

msgid "``CORE,$<$integer$>$``"
msgstr "``CORE,$<$integer$>$``"

msgid "``CLOSED,$<$integer$>$``"
msgstr "``CLOSED,$<$integer$>$``"

msgid "``OCC,$<$integer$>$``"
msgstr "``OCC,$<$integer$>$``"

msgid "``WF,charge=$<$integer$>$,sym=$<$integer$>$,spin=$<$integer$>$``"
msgstr "``WF,charge=$<$integer$>$,sym=$<$integer$>$,spin=$<$integer$>$``"

msgid ""
"For both the ``ORBITALS`` and ``ATOMS`` options, the active orbital space "
"(in a CASSCF wave function) or the open orbitals (in a single-reference wave"
" function) are always included in the embedding region. Therefore using an "
"empty ``ORBITALS`` or ``ATOMS`` option will embed only the active orbitals "
"e.g."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``ORBITALS`` 和 ``ATOMS`` 两个选项，活性轨道空间（在 CASSCF "
"波函数中）或开放轨道（在单参考波函数中）始终包含在嵌入区域中。因此，使用空的 ``ORBITALS`` 或 ``ATOMS`` "
"选项将仅嵌入活性轨道，例如"

msgid ""
"``OBRITALS=``\\ *:math:`<`string:math:`>`* Example: ‘[6,7,8,9-12]’. Indices "
"of IBOs to be embedded."
msgstr ""
"``OBRITALS=``\\ *:math:`<`string:math:`>`* 示例：‘[6,7,8,9-12]’。待嵌入的 IBO 索引。"

msgid ""
"``ATOMS=``\\ *:math:`<`string:math:`>`* Example: ‘[C1,C2,H3,H4-H6]’. "
"Orbitals exerting an IBO partial charge of at least ``THRESH_REGION`` on "
"these atoms are embedded."
msgstr ""
"``ATOMS=``\\ *:math:`<`string:math:`>`* 示例：‘[C1,C2,H3,H4-H6]’。对这些原子施加至少 "
"``THRESH_REGION`` 的 IBO 部分电荷的轨道将被嵌入。"

msgid ""
"``ORB_SELECT=``\\ *:math:`<`string:math:`>`* Either ‘INCLUSIVE’ or "
"‘EXCLUSIVE’. Controls how strictly embedded orbitals are selected, when "
"using the ``ATOMS`` option. Default=INCLUSIVE."
msgstr ""
"``ORB_SELECT=``\\ *:math:`<`string:math:`>`* 取值为 ‘INCLUSIVE’ 或 "
"‘EXCLUSIVE’。控制使用 ``ATOMS`` 选项时嵌入轨道选择的严格程度。默认=INCLUSIVE。"

msgid ""
"``HOST_ATOMS=``\\ *:math:`<`string:math:`>`* Example: ‘[C4,C5,H6-H10]’. List"
" of extra host atoms, added to those chosen automatically. Only relevant "
"when ``FULL_VIRT=false``."
msgstr ""
"``HOST_ATOMS=``\\ *:math:`<`string:math:`>`* "
"示例：‘[C4,C5,H6-H10]’。额外宿主原子的列表，添加到自动选择的宿主原子中。仅当 ``FULL_VIRT=false`` 时相关。"

msgid ""
"``THRESH_REGION=``\\ *:math:`<`double:math:`>`* IBO partial charge "
"threshold. Determines which orbitals are sat on those atoms specified with "
"the ``ATOMS`` option, as well as host atoms underneath embedded orbitals. "
"Default=0.2 atomic units."
msgstr ""
"``THRESH_REGION=``\\ *:math:`<`double:math:`>`* IBO 部分电荷阈值。确定哪些轨道位于由 "
"``ATOMS`` 选项指定的那些原子上，以及嵌入轨道下方的宿主原子。默认=0.2 原子单位。"

msgid ""
"``THRESH_REDUN=``\\ *:math:`<`double:math:`>`* Eigenvalue threshold. "
"Determines redundant virtual functions when ``FULL_VIRT=false``. Default=\\ "
":math:`1.0\\times10^{-8}`."
msgstr ""
"``THRESH_REDUN=``\\ *:math:`<`double:math:`>`* 本征值阈值。当 ``FULL_VIRT=false`` "
"时确定冗余虚函数。默认=\\ :math:`1.0\\times10^{-8}`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``SEMI_CAN=``\\ *:math:`<`logical:math:`>`* Control pseudo-canonicalisation "
"of the embedded orbital spaces. Default=true."
msgstr "``SEMI_CAN=``\\ *:math:`<`logical:math:`>`* 控制嵌入轨道空间的赝正则化。默认=true。"

msgid ""
"``FULL_VIRT=``\\ *:math:`<`logical:math:`>`* When true, the full canonical "
"virtual space from the previous SCF calculation is retained. When false, a "
"truncated virtual space is constructed. Default=true."
msgstr ""
"``FULL_VIRT=``\\ *:math:`<`logical:math:`>`* 为 true 时，保留先前 SCF 计算的完整正则虚空间。为 "
"false 时，构造截断的虚空间。默认=true。"

msgid ""
"``IBO_AO_TYPE=``\\ *:math:`<`string:math:`>`* Minimal basis set used by the "
"IBO program. Default is that of the IBO program (MINAO-PP)."
msgstr ""
"``IBO_AO_TYPE=``\\ *:math:`<`string:math:`>`* IBO 程序使用的最小基组。默认为 IBO "
"程序的基组（MINAO-PP）。"

msgid ""
"``PLOT_PAOS=``\\ *:math:`<`logical:math:`>`* Writes the PAOs to the dump "
"record, so they can be visualized by an orbital viewing program. "
"Default=false."
msgstr ""
"``PLOT_PAOS=``\\ *:math:`<`logical:math:`>`* 将 PAO 写入 dump "
"记录，以便可通过轨道可视化程序显示。默认=false。"

msgid ""
"``PRINT_MAP=``\\ *:math:`<`logical:math:`>`* Prints a mapping of the "
"rearranged IBO indices to the original IBO indices. Default=true."
msgstr ""
"``PRINT_MAP=``\\ *:math:`<`logical:math:`>`* 打印重排后的 IBO 索引到原始 IBO "
"索引的映射。默认=true。"

msgid ""
"``REGION_TYPE=``\\ *:math:`<`integer:math:`>`* When set to 0, the atomic "
"core and environment valence orbitals are totally deleted. This allows the "
"user to plot the embedded orbitals only, though cannot be used for viable "
"calculations. When set to 1, the atomic core and environment orbitals are "
"placed into the core. These orbitals must be used for actual calculations. "
"Default=1."
msgstr ""
"``REGION_TYPE=``\\ *:math:`<`integer:math:`>`* 设为 0 "
"时，原子核心和环境价层轨道被完全删除。这允许用户仅绘制嵌入轨道，但不能用于可行的计算。设为 1 "
"时，原子核心和环境轨道被放入核心。这些轨道必须用于实际计算。默认=1。"
